{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nThe task filters leave consumer exception-span-event assertions unexecuted and omit producer error telemetry from collection.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>2 open issues</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Retain synchronous producer send failure test](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20645#discussion_r4301209507) \u00b7 New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Include testConsumerError in receive telemetry profile](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20645#discussion_r4301209550) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>1 resolved since last review</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Catalog tests omit successful wrapper telemetry metrics](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20645#discussion_r4296680902)\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5555944763","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5555944763},{"body":"[Testing] Replacing collection of `:library:test` with this success-only filter excludes `WrapperSendExceptionTest.producerSpanEndedWhenSendThrowsSynchronously`. That test uses builder defaults and exports a producer span with `error.type`. The other collected profiles contain no failed sends, and the logs profile fails only a consumer poll, so regenerated producer metadata loses this supported attribute. Include the existing failed-send test in this default profile.","comment_commit_id":"2b6739d57d7151592512353dde80a3453f2b75fa","comment_id":4301209507,"key":"inline:4301209507","kind":"inline","line":31,"original_commit_id":"2b6739d57d7151592512353dde80a3453f2b75fa","original_line":31,"path":"instrumentation/kafka/kafka-clients/kafka-clients-2.6/library/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"2b6739d57d7151592512353dde80a3453f2b75fa","review_id":5555944763,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-17T03:54:15Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"381ab621e49ba901705b444437b6ce3a570a004d28e2b1df0378c70bae696021","id":4301209507,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:54:15Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86tcoKu"},{"body":"[Testing] `testConsumerError` now skips the ordinary `test` JVM because receive telemetry is disabled. Both receive-enabled success profiles exclude it, so it runs only in `testExceptionSignalLogs`, where exception span events are disabled. Include it in `testReceiveTelemetry` to preserve the existing default exception-as-span-event assertions.","comment_commit_id":"2b6739d57d7151592512353dde80a3453f2b75fa","comment_id":4301209550,"key":"inline:4301209550","kind":"inline","line":41,"original_commit_id":"2b6739d57d7151592512353dde80a3453f2b75fa","original_line":41,"path":"instrumentation/kafka/kafka-clients/kafka-clients-2.6/library/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"2b6739d57d7151592512353dde80a3453f2b75fa","review_id":5555944763,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-17T03:54:15Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"0718a92b2f76d32a675197aa402984427bf3fc325a3d340ecfc0710c6925fa54","id":4301209550,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:54:15Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86tcoK_"}],"frozen_at":1792209781,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-17T04:03:01Z","frozen_sha":"2b6739d57d7151592512353dde80a3453f2b75fa","head_ref":"copilot/task-kafka-2-6-library-metadata-profile","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":39001082600},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nApply #20649's test-profile and telemetry-collection guidance to Kafka 2.6 library instrumentation, continuing the follow-up tracked in #20546 and #20416.\n\nSeparate default and opt-in profiles, label builder-configured options with builder calls, and collect representative wrapper and interceptor telemetry while preserving regression coverage.","title":"Separate Kafka 2.6 library telemetry collection profiles"},"mode":"publish","pr":20645,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v